      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T08:01:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My initial thought is to put every state set defined in DSP 0249 under state.decorator so that it can be more generalized and used by any type of inventory item.\n\nHowever, after checking the DMTF redfish scheme in the following link:\nhttps://redfish.dmtf.org/schemas/v1/Port.v1_19_0.json\n\nI noticed that only `Port` object exposes these LinkStatus, and thus I have decided to move this `LinkStatus` definition under `Inventory.Connector.Port` as one of its properties.\n\nThe tradeoff is that if we found any PLDM entity monitored by PLDM state sensor for state set Link Status that are not `Connector.Port`, we will have to define this interface for it again.",
      "parentUuid": "4e2ea54d_ba624a81",
      "revId": "b1a0c59fb41769774b18af3ffa002815e1809094",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
