      "side": 1,
      "message": "`connected_to` says what the port is physically attached to at the other end, while `LinkStatus` says whether the link on that port is up. \n\nTo address the confusing term, I have modified the values to `Up`/`Down` to avoid the word collision here. I hope this addresses your concern.",
